== Walkthrough ==

A little girl named Lucie Elron has gone missing. Her father Guard Elron, in Qeynos North, wants someone to look for her. He has already hired some citizens to search for her. It turns out she was eaten by a small gelatinous cube named Cuburt in the Qeynos Aqueducts. All now that remains of her is the [[Small Tattered Dress]]. If you find this, you may return it to either Guard Elron himself, or one of his hired men, Zamel or Endric (both found in Qeynos South).

This quest can start with any of those three people. The quest dialogue of each of the three:

'''Guard Elron (Qeynos North)'''

You say, 'Hail, Guard Elron'

: Guard Elron says 'Greetings. I am sorry but I can't concentrate on my post and talk to you at the same time.  Especially when I should be out searching for [Lucie]..  Please excuse me.'

You say, 'Who is Lucie?'

: Guard Elron says 'Lucie is my only daughter.  Her mother was killed by gnolls a little over a year ago.  Now Lucie is missing.  Ton Firepride said he saw her playing in the south pond.  I have told her a million times to stay out of the aqueducts..  She never listens..  Now I spend every free moment searching for my little girl..  If only I could find some clue to her fate..  Well, I need to get back to work.  Fare well, Arctura.'

'''Handing in the [[Small Tattered Dress]] to Guard Elron shows this:''' 

: Guard Elron says 'Oh dear.. no.. no.. I warned her about the aqueducts.. I warned her.. I coudn't watch her every minute of the day, could I? Oh Lucie.. Why didn't you listen to me? Here, take this. It belonged to her mother. She always said that in times of need, it gave her courage to go on.. Thank you so much for your efforts.'

